OL,3,ASchools close early again for A66 crash
OL,4,Afuneral
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiddlesbrough Council said some schools
OL,7,Fhad chosen to close ahead of Monday's
OL,8,Ffuneral, including a primary school
OL,9,Fwhich claimed the move would "ensure
OL,10,Fsafe transit home for all our
OL,11,Ffamilies".
OL,13,FSchools in neighbouring South Bank
OL,14,Fclosed early on Friday for Jakub
OL,15,FMatusiak's funeral, which police said
OL,16,F"passed without issue" and with "very
OL,17,Fminimal traffic disruption".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
